WEBVTT


00:00:00.080 --> 00:00:01.980
What's your name? Karolina.

00:00:02.120 --> 00:00:03.960
And where are you from? I'm from Poland.

00:00:03.961 --> 00:00:06.241
What made you wanna come to Korea in the first place?

00:00:06.242 --> 00:00:08.401
I was in Japan, but like I didn't have money.

00:00:08.402 --> 00:00:09.881
The flights to Korea were the cheapest

00:00:09.882 --> 00:00:12.301
and that's how I came to Korea for the first time.

00:00:12.440 --> 00:00:15.520
So what's the difference between Korean guys and Japanese guys?

00:00:15.521 --> 00:00:17.041
Korean guys, they're like cool.

00:00:17.042 --> 00:00:18.681
You know, they know how to behave

00:00:18.682 --> 00:00:20.861
but was not into like Asian guys at all.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:22.720
But they were better than Japanese guys.

00:00:22.721 --> 00:00:23.801
So I was like a bit shocked.

00:00:23.802 --> 00:00:25.401
And Japanese guys, I don't know,

00:00:25.402 --> 00:00:26.641
like they're a bit cringy.

00:00:26.642 --> 00:00:27.781
I mean, they're cute,

00:00:27.840 --> 00:00:30.300
but like I'm not a fan of them.

00:00:30.360 --> 00:00:34.360
Once I went for a day with a Japanese guy and he cried when he saw me

00:00:34.361 --> 00:00:36.921
and I was like, okay,

00:00:36.922 --> 00:00:39.801
why did he cry? He was like,

00:00:39.802 --> 00:00:43.201
I've never seen such a beautiful white woman before in my entire life.

00:00:43.202 --> 00:00:45.195
And he was like crying. I was like, bro, what the.
